                    'model: under unobserved perturbation u_k we observe delta[k] and the '
                    'regression on delta[k] gives the inter-gene Jacobian projection. '
                    'Stepwise-LOOCV prevents dense overfitting in the underdetermined regime '
                    '(15 samples, 24 features).'
                ),
                'strengths': [
                    'Uses an entirely different data source, so agreement with Method A is '
                    'informative.',
                    'Each row of inferred B has small mean support (%.2f preds/gene) and '
                    'the resulting graph is sparse and interpretable.' % n_nz_per_gene.mean(),
                ],
                'limitations': [
                    'Severe underdetermination: 15 obs vs 24 candidate predictors per row. '
                    'Only a handful of edges are recovered per gene.',
                    'Linear approximation may break for the 3 large-magnitude perturbation '
